  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\n・{貯金|ちょきん}する (to save money)\n・{貯金|ちょきん}を{下|お}ろす (to withdraw savings)\n・{貯金|ちょきん}がある/ない (to have/not have savings)\n\nCOMMON COMPOUND WORDS:\n・{貯金|ちょきん}{箱|ばこ} (piggy bank, savings box)\n・{定期|ていき}{貯金|ちょきん} (fixed-term deposit)\n・{普通|ふつう}{貯金|ちょきん} (regular savings account)\n・{郵便|ゆうびん}{貯金|ちょきん} (postal savings)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・{貯金|ちょきん}: Savings, deposits (general term, often postal savings)\n・{預金|よきん}: Bank deposit (specifically at banks)\n・{貯蓄|ちょちく}: Savings (broader, includes investments)",
